About 21 million adults in the U.S. suffer from depression. For some of them, the first-line treatments of therapy and antidepressant drugs don't help. So what can they do? In recent years, another treatment option has emerged, transcranial magnetic stimulation, or TMS, which uses high-powered magnets to stimulate electrical activity in targeted areas of the brain and can alleviate or put into remission people's treatment-resistant depression. Brain stimulation treatments, including TMS, are not new, but in recent years they've become more effective and more available, and TMS has earned the approval of the U.S. Food and Drug
在美国，约有2100万成年人患有抑郁症。对于其中一些人来说，药物治疗和心理咨询等一线治疗方法并无效果。那么他们该怎么办呢？近年来，一种新的治疗选择应运而生，即经颅磁刺激（TMS）。它利用高功率磁铁刺激大脑特定区域的电活动，可以缓解甚至治愈人们的难治性抑郁症。包括TMS在内的大脑刺激疗法并非新鲜事物，但近年来它们变得更加有效且更易获得，TMS也已获得了美国食品药品监督管理局的批准。那么它是如何工作的呢？

